---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "Brand Name Search in India | Preliminary Trademark Check";
const description = "Conduct a preliminary brand name search on the Indian trademark database before filing. Identify phonetic, visual, and conceptual similarities with BRNDNUR.";
const canonical = "https://brndnur.com/brand-name-search/";
---

<BaseLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonical={canonical}
  currentPath="/brand-name-search/"
>
  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">Pre-Filing Clearance</p>
        <h1>Check Your Brand Name Before You Move Forward.</h1>
        <p class="lead">A preliminary trademark search is the most critical first step before launching a brand or investing in packaging, signage, and marketing. We inspect the official Indian IP database to identify potentially conflicting marks.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://wa.me/919048188899?text=Hello%20BRNDNUR%2C%20I%20would%20like%20a%20preliminary%20brand-name%20search." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Request a Free Search &rarr;</a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/trademark-classes/">Understand Classes</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading text-center">
          <p class="eyebrow">Search Depth</p>
          <h2>What a Comprehensive Search Examines</h2>
          <p>A basic word search is rarely sufficient. Trade mark examiners in India evaluate marks on multiple distinct dimensions under Section 11 of the Trade Marks Act:</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-grid">
          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon">🔊</div>
            <h3>Phonetic Similarity</h3>
            <p>Marks that sound identical or very similar when spoken aloud (e.g., 'Kool' vs 'Cool') can be rejected even if spelling differs significantly.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon">👁️</div>
            <h3>Visual & Structural Similarity</h3>
            <p>Similar letter arrangements, prefixes, suffixes, or logo emblems that create a confusing visual impression to the ordinary consumer.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon">🧠</div>
            <h3>Conceptual & Semantic Overlap</h3>
            <p>Names that convey the exact same commercial idea or direct translations in different languages within the same market category.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon">🚫</div>
            <h3>Absolute Grounds (Section 9)</h3>
            <p>Evaluating whether the name is purely descriptive (e.g., 'Best Tea'), generic, deceptive, or lacks inherent distinctiveness.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-alt">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading text-center">
          <p class="eyebrow">Search Limitations</p>
          <h2>Setting Honest Expectations.</h2>
          <p>Transparency is foundational to our advisory ethos. A preliminary search provides invaluable strategic direction, but visitors must understand its statutory boundaries:</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-grid">
          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon">⚖️</div>
            <h3>Not a Final Guarantee</h3>
            <p>The Trade Marks Registry makes the statutory decision during examination. Unindexed recent applications or prior common-law user claims may exist.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon">🛡️</div>
            <h3>Risk Mitigation Tool</h3>
            <p>A search does not eliminate 100% of risk, but it dramatically reduces the likelihood of facing immediate objections, oppositions, or infringement notices.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon">💡</div>
            <h3>Strategic Alternatives</h3>
            <p>If your desired name has direct conflicts, we help you brainstorm modified prefixes, suffixes, or distinctive coinages before filing.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cta-panel">
          <p class="eyebrow">Start Early</p>
          <h2>Have a Name in Mind?</h2>
          <p>Send us your proposed brand name and products. We will conduct an initial check and share an objective appraisal.</p>
          <div class="cta-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-gold" href="https://wa.me/919048188899?text=Hello%20BRNDNUR%2C%20please%20search%20my%20brand%20name." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Send Name on WhatsApp &rarr;</a>
            <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/trademark-registration/">Trademark Registration Details</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
